     "source": "trillion media-workspace scheduled-calendar.mjs and calendar-placement.mjs (the Mac's Schedule month, week and day views), rebuilt on src/social-posts.mjs calendar, the same read list_post_calendar makes (a2fdfe6), ported to the records door"
